":["Compliance","Utilities"],"customOrder":null},"authorWorkspace":{},"resource":{"id":"659196de7aaa6e39dfa26a3c"},"features":["Stay GDPR compliant","Premium templates","Customize everything inside Webflow designer","Add or remove elements as needed","Give your site visitors the right amount of control"],"usedCount":23076,"metrics":{"installs":{"total":13111,"last30Days":270,"last7Days":57},"views":{"total":95134,"last30Days":2823,"last7Days":618},"uninstalls":{"total":4459,"last30Days":118,"last7Days":31},"likes":{"total":61,"last30Days":1,"last7Days":0}}},{"_id":"657237447d1232b8a6d66e7e","id":"657237447d1232b8a6d66e7e","name":"Clip Path Bae","slug":"clip-path-bae","thumbnailImage":{"url":"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/631e038956a8096204ca905f/657236e3fd7d1d51fac29089_06389509-1d1a-4e24-8226-b66439e2f04f.jpg","altText":"Clip Path Bae Logo of a hot pepper with cutout"},"categories":[],"status":"APPROVED","visibility":"PUBLIC","requiredPlans":[],"languages":[],"privacyPolicyUrl":"","termsOfServiceUrl":"","numViews":16331,"integrationMetadata":{"shortDescription":"Clip complex shapes without code.","tags":["Free"],"installUrl":"http://webflow.com/oauth/authorize?response_type=code\u0026client_id=eef8d2b6e07b72b545208b28504ae5fce90687929ff58eac2b8b557cf54e1dc7","websiteUrl":"https://webbae.net","promoVideoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xoLM-_bijtI\u0026feature=youtu.be","categories":["Design","Utilities"],"customOrder":null},"authorWorkspace":{},"resource":{"id":"654fb0755d0bbc1cfcf36204"},"features":["Improved Performance: Images with transparency, especially PNGs, can be quite large in file size. Using clip-path reduces the need for these larger image files, leading to smaller overall file sizes and faster load times for your website.","Scalability and Resolution Independence: clip-path shapes are resolution-independent, meaning they remain crisp and clear at any size. This is particularly beneficial for high-resolution displays, as opposed to raster images with transparency, which can become pixelated when scaled up.","Greater Design Flexibility: Changing the shape or size of an element using clip-path can be done directly in the CSS, which is much easier and quicker than editing an image in a graphic editing tool and re-uploading it to your website.","Dynamic Interactions and Animations: clip-path allows for dynamic interactions and animations. You can easily create hover effects, transitions, and animations on clipped elements, something that's not possible with static transparent images.","Better Accessibility and SEO: Text and other content clipped using clip-path remain as HTML/CSS and are thus accessible to screen readers and search engines. In contrast, text in images is not easily accessible or searchable."],"usedCount":84480,"metrics":{"installs":{"total":13091,"last30Days":63,"last7Days":19},"views":{"total":45542,"last30Days":1000,"last7Days":240},"uninstalls":{"total":504,"last30Days":9,"last7Days":2},"likes":{"total":56,"last30Days":0,"last7Days":0}}},{"_id":"635c44da6335a1158f0198bf","id":"635c44da6335a1158f0198bf","name":"Jetboost","slug":"jetboost","thumbnailImage":{"url":"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/6310f776e067393e3a059c6f/641346f3f5233cac33398617_Jetboost%2BIcon.png","altText":"Jetboost"},"categories":[],"status":"APPROVED","visibility":"PUBLIC","requiredPlans":[],"languages":[],"privacyPolicyUrl":"","termsOfServiceUrl":"","numViews":20522,"integrationMetadata":{"shortDescription":"CMS Superpowers: Filters, search, maps, geo search, likes, infinite scroll, sorting, and more","tags":["Paid","Free"],"installUrl":"https://www.jetboost.io/v2/install","websiteUrl":"https://www.jetboost.io","promoVideoUrl":"","categories":["Automation","Content Management"],"customOrder":null},"authorWorkspace":{},"resource":{"id":"664e12d0b6dcaad25bbc9734"},"features":["Easily implement search, filters, sorting, and pagination for your CMS","Create interactive, CMS-based maps or store locators powered by Mapbox","Le